  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Transitive pair: ⟦{散|ち}らかす→散らかす：04360_chirakasu⟧ (to make messy).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates resulting state. {散|ち}らかって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is messy' (state).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{散|ち}らかる (room becomes messy)\n- X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{散|ち}らかって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ (X is scattered/messy)\n- {散|ち}らかった⟦{部屋|へや}→部屋：00507_heya⟧ (a messy room)\n\nTRANSITIVE PAIR:\n- {散|ち}らかる (intransitive) - to be messy\n- ⟦{散|ち}らかす→散らかす：04360_chirakasu⟧ (transitive) - to make messy\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{乱|みだ}れる→乱れる：09506_midareru⟧ - to be in disorder (more general)\n- ⟦{散|ち}る→散る：02075_chiru⟧ - to scatter, fall (like petals)",
